pth":3,"id":"host","children":[{"type":"text","value":"host"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReactiveControllerHost"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Lit reactive controller host that owns the mutation cache\nsubscription."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationStateOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationStateOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResult"},{"type":"text","value":"> = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mutation state filters and optional selector."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"options-properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" properties"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Property"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Description"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"options-property-filters\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/Accessor.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Accessor"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/MutationFilters.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Filters used to select mutations from the mutation cache."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"options-property-select\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"select?"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mutation"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../classes/Mutation.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mutation"}]},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResult"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maps each matching mutation to the value returned by the accessor."}]}]]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queryclient","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queryClient?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../classes/QueryClient.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/MutationStateAccessor.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MutationStateAccessor"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResult"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An accessor for the selected mutation state array."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useMutationState } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass PendingUploads extends LitElement {\n  private readonly uploads = useMutationState(this, {\n    filters: { mutationKey: ['upload'], status: 'pending' },\n    select: (mutation) => mutation.state.variables as File,\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.uploads().length} uploads pending</span>`\n  }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tresult","text":"TResult","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"host","text":"host","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"options-properties","text":"options properties","level":4},{"id":"queryclient","text":"queryClient?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useMutationState<TResult>(\n   host: ReactiveControllerHost,\n   options?: MutationStateOptions<TResult>,\nqueryClient?: QueryClient): MutationStateAccessor<TResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/useMutationState.ts:186](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/useMutationState.ts#L186)\n\nCreates a Lit reactive controller that selects state from matching mutations\nin the mutation cache.\n\nWhen `options.filters` is a function, it is re-read during host updates so\nthe selection can follow reactive host state. If `queryClient` is omitted,\nthe controller resolves the client from the nearest connected\n`QueryClientProvider`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TResult\n\n`TResult` = [`MutationState`](../interfaces/MutationState.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit reactive controller host that owns the mutation cache\nsubscription.\n\n### options?\n\n[`MutationStateOptions`](../type-aliases/MutationStateOptions.md)\\<`TResult`\\> = `{}`\n\nMutation state filters and optional selector.\n\n<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `options` properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"options-property-filters\"></a> `filters?` | [`Accessor`](../type-aliases/Accessor.md)\\<[`MutationFilters`](../interfaces/MutationFilters.md)\\> | Filters used to select mutations from the mutation cache. |\n| <a id=\"options-property-select\"></a> `select?` | (`mutation`: [`Mutation`](../classes/Mutation.md)) => `TResult` | Maps each matching mutation to the value returned by the accessor. |\n\n### queryClient?\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nOptional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`MutationStateAccessor`](../type-aliases/MutationStateAccessor.md)\\<`TResult`\\>\n\nAn accessor for the selected mutation state array.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useMutationState } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass PendingUploads extends LitElement {\n  private readonly uploads = useMutationState(this, {\n    filters: { mutationKey: ['upload'], status: 'pending' },\n    select: (mutation) => mutation.state.variables as File,\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.uploads().length} uploads pending</span>`\n  }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useMutationState\ntitle: useMutationState\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useMutationState<TResult>(\n   host: ReactiveControllerHost,\n   options?: MutationStateOptions<TResult>,\nqueryClient?: QueryClient): MutationStateAccessor<TResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/useMutationState.ts:186](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/useMutationState.ts#L186)\n\nCreates a Lit reactive controller that selects state from matching mutations\nin the mutation cache.\n\nWhen `options.filters` is a function, it is re-read during host updates so\nthe selection can follow reactive host state. If `queryClient` is omitted,\nthe controller resolves the client from the nearest connected\n`QueryClientProvider`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TResult\n\n`TResult` = [`MutationState`](../interfaces/MutationState.md)\\<`unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`, `unknown`\\>\n\n## Parameters\n\n### host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit reactive controller host that owns the mutation cache\nsubscription.\n\n### options?\n\n[`MutationStateOptions`](../type-aliases/MutationStateOptions.md)\\<`TResult`\\> = `{}`\n\nMutation state filters and optional selector.\n\n<a id=\"options-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `options` properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"options-property-filters\"></a> `filters?` | [`Accessor`](../type-aliases/Accessor.md)\\<[`MutationFilters`](../interfaces/MutationFilters.md)\\> | Filters used to select mutations from the mutation cache. |\n| <a id=\"options-property-select\"></a> `select?` | (`mutation`: [`Mutation`](../classes/Mutation.md)) => `TResult` | Maps each matching mutation to the value returned by the accessor. |\n\n### queryClient?\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nOptional explicit query client. Provide this for\ncontrollers that should not resolve a client from Lit context.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`MutationStateAccessor`](../type-aliases/MutationStateAccessor.md)\\<`TResult`\\>\n\nAn accessor for the selected mutation state array.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nimport { LitElement, html } from 'lit'\nimport { useMutationState } from '@tanstack/lit-query'\n\nclass PendingUploads extends LitElement {\n  private readonly uploads = useMutationState(this, {\n    filters: { mutationKey: ['upload'], status: 'pending' },\n    select: (mutation) => mutation.state.variables as File,\n  })\n\n  render() {\n    return html`<span>${this.uploads().length} uploads pending</span>`\n  }\n}\n```\n"}
